<title>UK: NordLB adds 500 mln marks to June 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>NordLB adds 500 mln marks to June 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased by 500 million marks to 2.0 billion marks, joint lead managers Bankgesellschaft Berlin, Bayerische Landesbank, Norddeutsche Landesbank and Westdeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT  * 2.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    15.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.075    PAY DATE ** 01.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.225     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES    * ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED IN APRIL 1996</p>
<p>	  **  PLUS 106 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    HANNOVER  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.06	SELL CONC  0.165     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
